<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.2 pct in April 10-20.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.2 pct in April 10-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.2 percent in the April 10-20 period after rising 0.8 percent in the previous 10 days and were 1.2 percent higher than in the March 10-20 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				  APRIL 10-20 APRIL 1-10   LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.2	   0.8	  1.2 (1.1)</p>
<p> Bread				0.1	   0.4	  0.5 (0.6)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	   1.0	   5.0	  6.6 (6.3)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.1	   0.1	  0.4 (0.2)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.4	   0.7	  1.3 (1.4)</p>
<p> Eggs				-1.1	  -0.6	 -1.5 (-0.4)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on April 10.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
